    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/11ac18de18e979c0437eb2e28ac02fb0.avif?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a psychological horror adventure happening inside the mind of Felipe, a young boy with a unique perspective of the world.\u00a0Trapped in a space station on the brink of collapse, Felipe is forced to face the unknown, and his deepest fears as he explores his surroundings and fights for his freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Felipe is diagnosed with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD). Through Midnight Dreams, the game aims to promote empathy amongst players, and provide a broader, more immersive understanding on the topic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/210f1e89560eb2b16cdaa019b4a200f9.webp?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/60b3cee8cac0873da23cb2058bcd8cf2.poster.avif?t=1747772221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/60b3cee8cac0873da23cb2058bcd8cf2.webm?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/60b3cee8cac0873da23cb2058bcd8cf2.mp4?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/c943121beda7f2e236279438a86234d1.webp?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/9f949de15179efa58f81af9eda7dee96.poster.avif?t=1747772221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/9f949de15179efa58f81af9eda7dee96.webm?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/9f949de15179efa58f81af9eda7dee96.mp4?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/98d248b197ea805f5b4ca99ca5b4a4d1.webp?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/15c08bed2b5aaea1f729efdcb9c1beb5.poster.avif?t=1747772221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/15c08bed2b5aaea1f729efdcb9c1beb5.webm?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/15c08bed2b5aaea1f729efdcb9c1beb5.mp4?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/11ac18de18e979c0437eb2e28ac02fb0.avif?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a psychological horror adventure happening inside the mind of Felipe, a young boy with a unique perspective of the world.\u00a0Trapped in a space station on the brink of collapse, Felipe is forced to face the unknown, and his deepest fears as he explores his surroundings and fights for his freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Felipe is diagnosed with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD). Through Midnight Dreams, the game aims to promote empathy amongst players, and provide a broader, more immersive understanding on the topic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/210f1e89560eb2b16cdaa019b4a200f9.webp?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/60b3cee8cac0873da23cb2058bcd8cf2.poster.avif?t=1747772221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/60b3cee8cac0873da23cb2058bcd8cf2.webm?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/60b3cee8cac0873da23cb2058bcd8cf2.mp4?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/c943121beda7f2e236279438a86234d1.webp?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/9f949de15179efa58f81af9eda7dee96.poster.avif?t=1747772221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/9f949de15179efa58f81af9eda7dee96.webm?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/9f949de15179efa58f81af9eda7dee96.mp4?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/98d248b197ea805f5b4ca99ca5b4a4d1.webp?t=1747772221\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/15c08bed2b5aaea1f729efdcb9c1beb5.poster.avif?t=1747772221\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/15c08bed2b5aaea1f729efdcb9c1beb5.webm?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/15c08bed2b5aaea1f729efdcb9c1beb5.mp4?t=1747772221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
